'''Steambird''' is a [[:Category:Godly|godly]] [[:Category:Pets|pet]] that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Clockwork Item Pack]] for 1,299 Robux. It is now only obtainable through trading as the [[Gamepasses|gamepass]] has since went offsale.

== Trivia ==
*Its model derives from the ROBLOX gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/356212121/Steampunk-Attack-Birds Steampunk Attack Birds], purchasable from the avatar shop for 400 Robux.
*If you bought the [[Clockwork Item Pack]], it also came with the godly knife [[Clockwork]], and the [[Gear Storm|Gearstorm]] effect.
*It partners with the knife [[Clockwork]], and sometimes [[Gear Storm]] making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Clockwork Set|Clockwork Set]].

